      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Ideogram 4: img2img\n\nIdeogram 4 (Qwen3-VL 8B text encoder, FLUX.2 VAE) is strong at typography and layout. Write full sentences,\nput literal text in quotes and say where it goes. Guidance comes from a second, **unconditional** model\n(**Dual Model CFG Guider**), so there is no negative prompt; **CFG Override** lowers CFG to 3 over the last 30 % of\nthe steps.\n\n**Presets** (steps / Shift = scheduler `mu` / scheduler `std`): Default 20 / 0 / 1.75, Quality 48 / 0 / 1.5,\nTurbo 12 / 0.5 / 1.75. CFG 7, euler, 1024×1024 (multiples of 16, at least 256). `std` is set in the scheduler.\n\n## img2img\n\nThe image of **Load Image ib:img** is the starting point: **Resize to** scales it to the size of the Generate tab\n(Width / Height, its *Resize to* in img2img mode; **Use size** in the Input cell takes the size of the image),\n**VAE Encode** makes the latent, and the sampler adds noise by the **denoising** strength (0.6 here) and samples\nfrom there. The prompt describes the whole image you want. Low denoising keeps the composition and colors; high\ndenoising moves further from the image. To change one area only, use the inpaint workflow; to change the image by\nan instruction, an edit model with references.\n\nThe Generate tab is in **img2img** mode while this workflow is loaded. Send an image with **Send to the input\nimage** (B), from the editor, or upload it in the Input cell before the first queue. This workflow has no Hires.\nfix pass: upscale the result with the full workflow.\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model (the conditional model) | model list, model exploration |\n| `ib:img` | Load Image | Input cell; Send to the input image (B), the editor |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps and Shift (Ideogram 4 Scheduler `steps`, `mu`), CFG scale (Dual Model CFG Guider), sampling method, denoising; Resize to (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\nPut any ESRGAN-type model into\n`models/upscale_models` ([RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Real-ESRGAN_repackaged/resolve/main/RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors) here).\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt. They apply to the conditional\nmodel only.\n\nThe Generate tab has no negative prompt and no References panel here: Ideogram 4 takes no reference images. The\nControlNet tab has no units: there is no ControlNet for Ideogram 4.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**: [ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors), [ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**vae**: [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Ideogram 4 (Image Bench, img2img)",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
